
# Make Pearls Into Jewelry

>  I Know What You're Thinking, And No, I'm Not Saying It

---
At times, &eElder Guardians&r will drop &bPearls&r, which can be used to make rather fetching jewelry.
You can also get them from &6feeding Clams to &eOtters&r.

Obtain clams by &afishing&r in rivers, and then &6drop them on the ground&r by some &eOtters&r, and they will &acrack them open for you&r.

These &agrant bonuses&r when held in inventory, but &dcannot be worn as Curios&r.
            